This folder holds the PDF research papers referenced by the "file" field of
each entry in data/content.json's "research" array.

The two PDFs currently referenced there —
  extended-essay-home-router-security.pdf
  math-ia-password-bruteforce.pdf
— are not included in this commit and need to be added here, either by
committing them directly via git, or by uploading them through the admin
panel's Research section (admin.html), which commits straight to this path.

Delete this file once real PDFs have been added — it exists only so git
tracks this otherwise-empty directory.
